WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.640
You posted this great shot
of yourself as Joe Exotic.

00:00:03.640 --> 00:00:05.930
This is what happens when A,

00:00:05.930 --> 00:00:07.790
you have too much time on your hands,

00:00:07.790 --> 00:00:10.960
and your wife was one of
the leading makeup artists

00:00:10.960 --> 00:00:12.430
in the business.

00:00:12.430 --> 00:00:14.400
We just went to the attic,

00:00:14.400 --> 00:00:15.963
got the old makeup kit out,

00:00:16.950 --> 00:00:19.270
and I spent an entire day

00:00:19.270 --> 00:00:21.340
just having the most fun being Joe Exotic

00:00:21.340 --> 00:00:22.420
and I put it up for fun,

00:00:22.420 --> 00:00:23.253
and then the next thing you know,

00:00:23.253 --> 00:00:25.930
Ryan Murphy was like, let's go out

00:00:25.930 --> 00:00:27.280
and make this as a real movie.

00:00:27.280 --> 00:00:28.740
So we went out and
tried to get the rights,

00:00:28.740 --> 00:00:30.623
which of course were already gone.

00:00:31.510 --> 00:00:32.673
Who has the rights?

00:00:32.673 --> 00:00:35.000
Do you know who has the rights?

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:37.980
Turns out a consortium, 'cause I think,

00:00:37.980 --> 00:00:39.220
is it always consortiums

00:00:39.220 --> 00:00:41.660
that have rights as opposed to one person?

00:00:41.660 --> 00:00:43.000
I think so, consortiums,

00:00:43.000 --> 00:00:44.460
I always think of as evil, too,

00:00:44.460 --> 00:00:45.780
which is probably true.

00:00:45.780 --> 00:00:47.200
Well, Nick Cage is involved in it.

00:00:47.200 --> 00:00:48.050
Oh, Nick Cage!

00:00:48.050 --> 00:00:49.360
Oh my God, okay, yeah.

00:00:49.360 --> 00:00:51.890
Nick Cage is always part
of every consortium.

00:00:51.890 --> 00:00:52.930
Isn't he, though?

00:00:52.930 --> 00:00:53.930
If there's a consortium

00:00:53.930 --> 00:00:56.110
trying to buy up all the oil in Alaska,

00:00:56.110 --> 00:00:57.750
Nick Cage is in there.

00:00:57.750 --> 00:00:58.645
Yes, that's what I'm saying.
He's part of

00:00:58.645 --> 00:00:59.820
every consortium.

00:00:59.820 --> 00:01:01.840
Yeah, so it's a Nick Cage consortium.

00:01:01.840 --> 00:01:02.760
[Conan] Oh my God.

00:01:02.760 --> 00:01:06.240
But listen, I stand down
at the alter of Nick,

00:01:06.240 --> 00:01:10.560
the notion of Nicholas
Cage as the Lion King.

00:01:10.560 --> 00:01:12.640
I mean, I got nothing to offer there.

00:01:12.640 --> 00:01:13.907
He'd be great, he'd be great.

00:01:13.907 --> 00:01:17.220
But I got to say, the picture
had me wanting to see...

00:01:18.380 --> 00:01:20.970
I thought this could happen when I saw it.

00:01:20.970 --> 00:01:22.340
It is the role of a lifetime.

00:01:22.340 --> 00:01:25.050
Like when I watched that,
I was like, you know,

00:01:25.050 --> 00:01:26.420
'cause whenever I usually,

00:01:26.420 --> 00:01:28.730
I don't get to do
hardcore character stuff.

00:01:28.730 --> 00:01:31.267
I mean, when I did
"Behind the Candelabra,"

00:01:32.330 --> 00:01:33.740
I got to do a lot and I love it

00:01:33.740 --> 00:01:35.810
whenever I can do prosthetic stuff,

00:01:35.810 --> 00:01:37.320
it's just a great escape for me,

00:01:37.320 --> 00:01:38.290
and it's kind of freeing,

00:01:38.290 --> 00:01:39.960
and I thought this would be great.

00:01:39.960 --> 00:01:41.630
So I'm always looking
for something like it.

00:01:41.630 --> 00:01:43.970
I forgot about "Behind the Candelabra."

00:01:43.970 --> 00:01:45.190
That was fantastic.

00:01:45.190 --> 00:01:48.840
And you had your character,
who's a plastic surgeon

00:01:48.840 --> 00:01:53.378
had an insane amount of the
prosthetics they did on you.

00:01:53.378 --> 00:01:56.090
You were completely absurd looking.

00:01:56.090 --> 00:01:57.230
And then like most people

00:01:57.230 --> 00:01:59.390
who've had terrible plastic surgery,

00:01:59.390 --> 00:02:03.110
you were completely unaware
that you looked crazy.

00:02:03.110 --> 00:02:05.450
That was my favorite
part of the character.

00:02:05.450 --> 00:02:07.140
And not only that, I'm a bad surgeon.

00:02:07.140 --> 00:02:11.130
So when I give Michael
Douglas his Liberace surgery,

00:02:11.130 --> 00:02:13.910
he said, and it's got his
eyes pulled like this.

00:02:13.910 --> 00:02:18.150
And he says, "Doctor, will my
eyes ever be able to close?"

00:02:18.150 --> 00:02:21.087
And I say, "Probably not." (Conan laughs)

00:02:21.087 --> 00:02:22.387
"But look at it this way,

00:02:22.387 --> 00:02:24.427
"you'll always get to
see people's reactions

00:02:24.427 --> 00:02:26.177
"when they see how great you look."

00:02:27.380 --> 00:02:29.280
And I don't know if you noticed,

00:02:29.280 --> 00:02:32.790
but I look very androgynous

00:02:32.790 --> 00:02:33.950
and there was a lot of people

00:02:33.950 --> 00:02:36.370
playing sort of faux androgynous stuff,

00:02:36.370 --> 00:02:37.400
and I wanted to stand out.

00:02:37.400 --> 00:02:39.211
So I was like, I'll look androgynous

00:02:39.211 --> 00:02:41.610
but I'm going to use the voice of the guy

00:02:41.610 --> 00:02:43.520
from the Men's Warehouse.

00:02:43.520 --> 00:02:45.007
Yes, yeah.

00:02:45.007 --> 00:02:47.065
"You're gonna like the way you look."

00:02:47.065 --> 00:02:49.648
(Conan laughs)

